Note on assets / 素材说明:

This repository contains the source code of the project. It does **not**
contain any third-party anime media. Real cover images, videos and other
works' assets are supplied by the operator of each deployment and stored in
MinIO; they are never committed to this repository (`uploads/`, `.env*` are
git-ignored).

The images under `frontend/src/assets/` and
`backend/src/main/resources/static/api/media/` are original demo artwork
created for showcasing the interface, and are covered by the MIT license
above together with the rest of the source code.

If you deploy this project with your own catalog data, please make sure you
have the rights to the artwork, videos and metadata you import.

本仓库只包含项目源码，**不包含任何第三方动漫素材**。真实封面、视频等资源
由每个部署的使用者自行提供并存放于 MinIO，不会进入本仓库（`uploads/`、
`.env*` 均已被 git 忽略）。

`frontend/src/assets/` 与 `backend/src/main/resources/static/api/media/`
下的图片是为展示界面制作的原创演示素材，随源码一同以 MIT 协议开源。

如果你要用自己的馆藏数据部署本项目，请确保你拥有所导入图片、视频与元数据的
相应权利。
